oc-link\" href=\"#5%E3%80%81%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">5、模型训练的本质</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">训练的数学本质</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%92\"><span class=\"toc-text\">优化理论视角</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90\"><span class=\"toc-text\">学习机制深度解析</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">模式识别与抽象</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%B6%8C%E7%8E%B0%E7%8E%B0%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%88Emergence%EF%BC%89\"><span class=\"toc-text\">涌现现象（Emergence）</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-4\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E7%BC%A9%E6%94%BE%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%8B%EF%BC%88Scaling-Laws%EF%BC%89\"><span class=\"toc-text\">缩放定律（Scaling Laws）</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E5%B1%82%E9%9D%A2%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83\"><span class=\"toc-text\">哲学层面思考</span></a></li></ol></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#6%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%91%E5%B1%95%E4%B8%8E%E5%89%8D%E6%B2%BF%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF\"><span class=\"toc-text\">6、最新发展与前沿趋势</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4\"><span class=\"toc-text\">强化学习训练的突破</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#